  "body": "Property Files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/NW5W\r\n\r\nLocated in Auckland's sought-after East Coast Bays, this impressive home offers approximately 348sqm of floor area on a 504sqm freehold section, combining generous living spaces, stunning sea views and excellent schooling.\r\n\r\nHigh ceilings and expansive windows invite abundant natural light and frame sweeping views of the leafy neighbourhood, sparkling Hauraki Gulf and distant islands.\r\n\r\nThe home features six bedrooms, four bathrooms, two generous living areas, a spacious kitchen and separate dining room. The exceptionally spacious master suite includes its own private lounge and ensuite, while a guest suite offers additional privacy. A double internal-access garage and ample storage add everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nIn zone for and within walking distance of Murrays Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Rangitoto College (offering both NCEA and IB), the property offers an excellent educational pathway from Year 1 to Year 13.\r\n\r\nNearby are beaches, coastal walks, Murrays Bay Sailing Club, AUT Millennium sports centre and Mairangi Bay cafés, with easy access to Albany's commercial centre and the motorway.\r\n\r\nCome and experience the space, stunning sea views and coastal lifestyle for yourself!\r\n\r\n*Conjunctions from all Agents welcome*",
